  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan names Accumulating Ash Gu among the three rank three Gu worms inside a lava crocodile king while he and Bai Ning Bing scout a mountain valley on the road toward Bai Gu mountain.",
        "chapters": [
          207
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "sys_gu_worms",
          "char_bai_ning_bing",
          "loc_bai_gu_mountain"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The host is a thousand beast king lava crocodile sunning in a valley. Fang Yuan and Bai Ning Bing probe it, then plan to lure other beast kings into fighting it rather than attack head on, because Accumulating Ash Gu would heal the king in a battle of attrition. Before they can carry that plan out, a Xuan Yuan Divine Pheasant kills the crocodile king.",
        "chapters": [
          207
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "lava-crocodile-king-and-lost-chance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After the pheasant leaves, the two search the corpse. Flame stomach Gu is already destroyed as glass-like remains. Lava explosion Gu and Accumulating Ash Gu are gone. The narration says wild Gu leave and roam once the host dies, and that not obtaining Accumulating Ash Gu was within Fang Yuan’s expectations.",
        "chapters": [
          208
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "lava-crocodile-king-and-lost-chance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_wild_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Later chapters searched for this page do not name another capture or owner of Accumulating Ash Gu after that loss.",
        "chapters": [],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "no_citation",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "lava-crocodile-king-and-lost-chance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
